$ cat Inline.java
public class Inline {
    static int small(int a) { return a + 1; }
    static int big(int a) { /* 40줄쯤의 산술 — 164바이트 */ }
    public static void main(String[] x) {
        boolean useBig = x[0].equals("big");
        int n = Integer.parseInt(x[1]);
        long t0 = System.nanoTime(), s = 0;
        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) s += useBig ? big(i) : small(i);
        System.out.printf("%s %,d ms (s=%d)%n", x[0], (System.nanoTime()-t0)/1_000_000, s);
    }
}

# --- 1) 인라인되는지 본다 ---

$ java -XX:+UnlockDiagnosticVMOptions -XX:+PrintInlining -cp out Inline small 200000000
@ 49   Inline::small (4 bytes)   inline
$ java -XX:+UnlockDiagnosticVMOptions -XX:+PrintInlining -cp out Inline big 200000000
@ 40   Inline::big (164 bytes)   callee is too large

# --- 2) small 을 막고 재 본다 ---

$ java                                          -cp out Inline small 200000000
small 128 ms  /  133 ms  /  126 ms
$ java -XX:CompileCommand=dontinline,Inline::small -cp out Inline small 200000000
small 496 ms  /  486 ms  /  485 ms

$ java -XX:+UnlockDiagnosticVMOptions -XX:+PrintInlining \
       -XX:CompileCommand=dontinline,Inline::small -cp out Inline small 200000000
@ 49   Inline::small (4 bytes)   disallowed by CompileCommand    <- 실제로 막혔다

# --- 3) 안 된 시도 ---

$ java -XX:MaxInlineSize=200 -XX:FreqInlineSize=400 ... -cp out Inline big 200000000
@ 40   Inline::big (164 bytes)   callee is too large             <- 그대로다
  기본 560/619 ms   한계 올림 547/569 ms                          <- 차이도 없다
